orage</i></span><span class="chip" title="Optical fiber/connectivity + specialty glass for AI datacenter interconnect (Nvidia partnership)">GLW<i>AI Networking/Optics</i></span><span class="chip" title="Memory (DRAM/HBM). THESIS THREAT 2026-07-28: CXMT listed on Shanghai STAR (+400% debut) -- China's domestic DRAM champion is now publicly capitalised, on top of HBM3E ASP -51% from peak. Named, funded competitor where th">MU<i>AI Memory/Storage</i></span><span class="chip" title="Oracle Cloud Infrastructure -- hyperscaler cloud/AI-capex beneficiary">ORCL<i>Compute/Hyperscaler</i></span><span class="chip" title="AI NAND/enterprise-SSD supercycle. Same CXMT capitalisation threat as MU; highest beta in book (2.464) and 1.6x its risk cap">SNDK<i>AI Memory/Storage</i></span></div><div class="grp-h">Other</div><div class="chips" style="margin-bottom:12px"><span class="chip" title="Semicap vacuum/laser/photonics &amp; process-control tools for leading-edge + memory fab capex">MKSI<i>AI Semis/Fabs</i></span></div><p class="note" style="margin-top:8px">Hover any ticker for its thesis.</p></div></details>
